# Wave W17-L (Route 102): net stand — the bug catcher’s net stand by the east path: a hoop net hung on a post with the collecting bucket at its foot, on still turf (fully opaque, ground baked in). The design leaves the catcher’s gear by the ponds he checks every morning.
